---
import Icon from './FlowIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="requirements-example">
  <div class="requirement-sources">
    <div class="requirement-source"><Icon name="document" /><span class="requirement-label">The contract</span><h3>What Did We Agree?</h3><p>Interview the team and deliver a recommendations report.</p><span class="requirement-reference">Source: contract · Deliverables</span></div>
    <div class="requirement-source"><Icon name="regulations" /><span class="requirement-label">The regulatory requirement</span><h3>What Must The Work Satisfy?</h3><p>Review personal information before sharing the findings.</p><span class="requirement-reference">Source: regulatory document · Personal information</span></div>
    <div class="requirement-source"><Icon name="scope" /><span class="requirement-label">The working scope</span><h3>What Are We Planning To Do?</h3><p>Interviews, analysis and a report. No privacy review assigned.</p><span class="requirement-reference">Source: scope · Current draft</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="requirement-bridge"><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span><img src="/brand/hyphos-mark.svg" width="34" height="34" alt="" /><strong>Hyphos connects the sources to the work.</strong><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></div>
  <div class="requirement-result"><span class="requirement-label">A gap the team can act on</span><h3>The Recommendations Are Scoped<br />The Privacy Review Needs An Owner</h3><p>Bring the contract commitment, regulatory source and draft scope into the same review. Confirm which requirement applies, assign the missing work and keep the evidence linked.</p><div class="requirement-links"><span>Contract commitment</span><span>Regulatory source</span><span>Scope item</span><span>Owner & review</span></div></div>
  <figcaption class="v-caption">Illustrative consulting engagement · All contract terms, regulatory requirements and scope details above are fictional.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
.requirements-example{max-width:1040px;margin:auto!important;text-align:left;}
.requirement-sources{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px;}
.requirement-source{background:#2d3035;border:1px solid #575a60;border-radius:10px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;}
.requirement-source>svg{width:27px;height:27px;color:#d2b582;margin-bottom:20px;}
.requirement-label{font-size:.875rem;color:#d2b582;display:block;margin-bottom:12px;line-height:1.5;}
.requirements-example h3{color:#efeff0;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-size:1.35rem;margin:0 0 16px!important;}
.requirements-example p{color:#c9cace;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 24px!important;}
.requirement-reference{color:#bec0c4;font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.5;border-top:1px solid #ffffff26;padding-top:16px;margin-top:auto;}
.requirement-bridge{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px;padding:26px 0;color:#d2b582;}
.requirement-bridge strong{font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.5;}
.requirement-result{border:1px solid #b69259;background:#303237;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;max-width:810px;margin:auto;}
.requirement-result h3{font-size:clamp(1.45rem,3vw,2rem);}
.requirement-result p{max-width:690px;}
.requirement-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;}
.requirement-links span{border:1px solid #68635a;padding:7px 11px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.875rem;color:#e1d1b5;}
.requirements-example figcaption{text-align:center;}
@media(max-width:700px){.requirement-sources{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;}.requirement-source{padding:22px;}.requirement-source>svg{margin-bottom:12px;}.requirement-result{padding:22px;}.requirement-bridge{gap:10px;}.requirement-bridge strong{max-width:220px;}.requirement-bridge>span{display:none;}}
</style>
